#: ../../../fuel_contributing_model.md:1
msgid "Contributing a New Model"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_contributing_model.md:3
msgid ""
"The easiest way to contribute a new model is via [https://app.gazebosim.org/"
"fuel/models/upload](https://app.gazebosim.org/fuel/models/upload)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../fuel_contributing_model.md:5
msgid ""
"Fuel assumes that a model conforms to [Gazebo's model structure](https://"
"gazebosim.org/api/sim/8/meshtofuel.html). At minimum, a model must have "
"model.config and model.sdf files. Image thumbnails can be placed in a "
"thumbnails subdirectory. These images will be displayed on this website when "
"viewing the model."
msgstr ""
